confirm.text:
Open this link to confirm your e-mail address:

{link}

The link works for one day. If you did not create an account, ignore this message.

reset.text:
Open this link to choose a new password:

{link}

The link works for one day. If you did not ask for it, ignore this message.

change.text:
Open this link to use this address for your account:

{link}

If you did not ask for this change, ignore this message.

exists.text:
Someone tried to create an account with this address, which has one already. Sign in here:

{link}

If you forgot your password, use the password reset on that page.
